   "kind": "description",
   "html": "I developed a typographic identity and menu/signage standards that complement décor rather than overpower it, exploring classical letterforms and monochrome treatments and collaborating with the venue team to harmonize with florals and finishes; the elegant mark elevates the space while letting the setting shine.",
